{
  "id": "throat_ilka_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "The readers' room has one window, facing the vent fields, and a board under it with eleven days of nothing written on it. Ilka is looking at the board rather than the window. \"You have come about the chain.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "the_chain",
          "text": "What chain?",
          "effects": [
            {
              "emit": {
                "event": "startQuest",
                "data": {
                  "quest": "throat_gone_quiet"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "eleven_days",
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "throat_gone_quiet",
                "status": "unstarted"
              },
              {
                "quest": "the_undercroft",
                "status": "complete"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "the_eleven",
          "text": "Who are the eleven?",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_eleven"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [
        {
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "throat_the_signal_deep",
                "status": "active"
              }
            ],
            "flags": [
              {
                "flag": "throat_readings_found",
                "equals": true
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "about_the_readings"
        },
        {
          "requires": {
            "flags": [
              {
                "flag": "throat_wyrm_down",
                "equals": true
              }
            ],
            "without": {
              "flags": [
                {
                  "flag": "throat_heeded"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "throat_hauled"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "goto": "heed_or_haul"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the_eleven",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"We watch what the ground is doing and we are believed,\" says Ilka, \"which is a strange thing to be paid for and I would not swap it.\" She does not look away from the board. \"We are believed because twice we were not, and both times there is a village under the ash. You can walk on the roofs of one of them at Ashfall.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "text": "Hm.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "eleven_days",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"There is a chain across the Great Vent. Iron, two hundred feet, hung in the year the hold was cut.\" She taps the board. \"It moves. It has moved every day for nine hundred years, because the vent breathes and the chain hangs in the breath.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It has hung still for eleven days,\" says Ilka. \"The longest before this was two.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "and_that_means",
          "text": "And that means?",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "not_finished"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "not_finished",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"That it has stopped breathing out,\" she says. \"Which is not the same as having finished. The other nine will not put that in writing and I will.\" She finally turns round. \"Go and look at it. I want somebody who is not one of the eleven to have stood under it.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "go",
          "text": "We'll stand under it.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "setFlag": {
                "flag": "throat_chain_seen",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": true,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "go_out"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "go_out",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "Two hundred feet of iron across a hole with no bottom in it, and not one link of it is moving. The air over the vent is cold, which on the Ember Reach is the wrong way round for everything."
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Cold,\" says Ilka, when you tell her. \"Then it is drawing in. And there are two years on the wall at the Signal Deep where somebody wrote exactly that.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "the_deep",
          "text": "Where's the Signal Deep?",
          "effects": [
            {
              "emit": {
                "event": "startQuest",
                "data": {
                  "quest": "throat_the_signal_deep"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "under_the_towers",
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "throat_the_signal_deep",
                "status": "unstarted"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "under_the_towers",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Under the firewatch towers, and you will not find it from the ridge path — it is behind the fallen tower and it is meant to be difficult.\" A thin smile. \"Nine hundred years of readings cut into a wall, in the one place on the Reach that will not burn.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "done",
          "text": "Behind the fallen tower.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "about_the_readings",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"You found the wall.\" Ilka is standing now. \"Which two years?\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "two_years",
          "text": "Year one-ninety, and year six-forty. Both say cold, and both say still.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": true,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "both_times"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "both_times",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Both times somebody went down the Throat,\" says Ilka, \"and both times the chain moved again inside a month, and neither of them wrote down what was down there.\" She is very still. \"Which I have always taken as a courtesy to whoever went next.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "go_down",
          "text": "Then we're whoever goes next.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "emit": {
                "event": "startQuest",
                "data": {
                  "quest": "throat_down_the_throat"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "adjustReputation": {
                "faction": "the_vent_readers",
                "amount": 6
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_rope",
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "throat_down_the_throat",
                "status": "unstarted"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [],
      "remembers": "vent_heeded"
    },
    {
      "id": "the_rope",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"The last one left the rope,\" says Ilka. \"Four hundred years ago. Do not use the rope.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "done",
          "text": "We'll bring our own.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "heed_or_haul",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "The board has a figure on it again, and Ilka has been standing in front of it long enough that somebody has brought her a chair she has not sat in. \"It is breathing,\" she says. \"Harder than the wall has ever recorded, and I would rather it were still.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I can sound it,\" she says. \"The bell goes, the works stop, Cinderhold empties down the smoking road inside a day, and if I am wrong the eleven are ten by Highsun and nobody believes the ten again.\" A pause. \"Or the foundry finishes the Karn Dolur contract. Forty tons. Eleven days. And the Reach runs on the foundry, which is a fact and not an argument.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "sound_it",
          "text": "Sound it. You've been right twice.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "setFlag": {
                "flag": "throat_heeded",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": true,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "sounded"
        },
        {
          "id": "haul",
          "text": "Let them finish the contract.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "setFlag": {
                "flag": "throat_hauled",
                "value": true
              }
            },
            {
              "grantItem": {
                "target": {
                  "ref": "actor.id"
                },
                "item": "hold_silver",
                "quantity": 5
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": true,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "hauled"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sounded",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "The bell goes at first light and Cinderhold is on the smoking road by noon with what it can carry, complaining the whole way, which Ilka says is the sound of it working."
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "done",
          "text": "Sounded.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [],
      "remembers": "vent_heeded"
    },
    {
      "id": "hauled",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "The ore moves. Ilka writes the reading on the board in full, signs it, and puts the date on it, which is what a vent-reader does instead of arguing."
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "done",
          "text": "...",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [],
      "remembers": "warning_ignored"
    }
  ]
}
